    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d781">

                <pb facs="0717" n="633" xml:id="pg633"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72114/2929</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-04T14:00:00+00:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 4, 1917, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 7.25 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7325. Howland and Dresel have telegraphed you their disapproval of Harte’s comprehensive scheme to feed prisoners.
                    They report to me that they can make no practical progress with British
                    Government because of Harte’s scheme
                    which the British Government knows. They ask me to take up subject of feeding
                    Russian and Servian prisoners in Germany with the Foreign Office. Please
                    instruct me. The British Government will ask among other questions whether
                    enormous food supply [will be] required and [whether] we can guarantee
                    transaction, and precisely what machinery of distribution can be set up to
                    insure that food reaches prisoners and nobody else.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Page</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
